00:00:01,158 --> 00:00:10,156
Benzene has molar mass seventy eight, so thirty nine grams is half a mole, giving half a mole of chlorobenzene in theory.

3
00:00:10,156 --> 00:00:16,796
Chlorobenzene's molar mass is one twelve point five, so fifty six point two five grams.

4
00:00:16,796 --> 00:00:20,195
At eighty percent yield, forty five grams.

